    "## 📚 Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates the **core search functionality** available in the Meijer API:\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🔍 **Core Search Capabilities**\n",
    "- **Autocomplete**: Real-time search suggestions via `client.search.autocomplete()`\n",
    "- **Main Search**: Comprehensive product search via `client.search.search()`\n",
    "- **Pagination**: Navigate through large result sets using `SearchResult` properties\n",
    "- **Store Filtering**: Filter by store availability using search parameters\n",
    "\n",
    "### 📊 **Core Analytics & Tracking**\n",
    "- **Click Tracking**: Monitor product interactions via `client.search.track_product_click()`\n",
    "- **Behavior Analytics**: Track user search patterns via `client.search.track_search_behavior()`\n",
    "- **Session Management**: Maintain user context automatically\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🖼️ **Core Content Management**\n",
    "- **Product Images**: Generate image URLs via `client.search.get_product_images()`\n",
    "- **Department Icons**: Access navigation assets via `client.search.get_department_icons()`\n",
    "- **Marketing Graphics**: Retrieve promotional content via `client.search.get_complex_promotions()`\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🔗 **Core API Integration**\n",
    "- **Constructor.io**: Primary search functionality via `client.search.*` methods\n",
    "- **Meijer API**: Product data and promotions via `client.search.get_sponsored_products()`\n",
    "- **Content CDN**: Asset delivery via built-in URL generation\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🚀 **Core Use Cases**\n",
    "- **E-commerce Applications**: Product discovery using `SearchResult` filtering and sorting\n",
    "- **Search Engines**: Intelligent product search with relevance scoring\n",
    "- **Analytics Platforms**: User behavior analysis with built-in tracking\n",
    "- **Mobile Apps**: Native search experience with proper data models\n",
    "\n",
    "The search functionality provides a **production-ready**, **feature-complete** search experience that mirrors the official Meijer mobile application, with all functionality properly implemented in the core classes rather than as notebook examples."
   ]
  }
